    "description": "Fantastic views across an archery field to Highgate Woods are the focus of two new contemporary extensions to a small family house in Muswell Hill.\r\nFeatures include: Green roof, Zinc cladding, Stainless steel kitchen, Beautiful tiling, Big windows, Pebbledash crown, and a sculptural concrete bench.",
